            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "elements": [
                "I organized this panel discussion during my time as the 'freemove' project coordinator."
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Keypoints",
              "type": "list",
              "elements": [
                "Transdisciplinary exploration of gdpr conform usage of mobility data",
                "5 Universities & DLR"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title":"Summary",
              "type": "text",
              "elements": [
                "The project goal was to explore the GDPR conform usage of sensitive mobility data, f.e. GPS data. The partners strived to align viewpoints from the fields of law, human-computer interaction, security & distributed computing, machine learning, and public participation to create a holistic and easy to follow guide for companies to leverage sensitive user data."
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "I was responsible for",
              "type": "list",
              "elements": [
                "Coordinating partner workflows",
                "Budget planning and monitoring",
                "Official communication with project sponsor and stakeholders",
                "Organization and moderation of stakeholder workshops"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "subtitle": "A transdisciplinary lens on GDPR conform usage of GPS data",
          "detail": {
            "organization": "CityLab Berlin",
            "link": "www.freemove.space",
            "date": "04/2021 - 04/2022"
          }
        }
      },
