              "type": "text",
              "elements": [
                "The focus of my studies were public participation and digital means of planning. Next to the practical projects offered in the bachelors degree, I participated in extracurricular activities such as summer schools and hackathons. In my bachelor thesis I investigated the just distribution of public space between the different traffic modes. The goal was to understand the usability of the political term 'Flächengerechtigkeit' as an indicator for a just distribution of public space."
